{"strongs": "H7522", "word": "רָצוֺן", "translit": "ra.tson", "root": "רפש", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "goodwill, favour, acceptance, will", "definition": "רָצוֺן noun [masculine] goodwill, favour, acceptance, will ; — absolute ׳ ר Deut 33:23 +; construct רְצוֺן Ps 145:19 +; suffix רְצוֺנִי Isa 60:10 , רְצֹנוֺ Dan 8:4 +, etc.; — 1. goodwill, favour: \\ \\ a. of God, Deut 33:16 ; Isa 60:10 ; Ps 5:13 ; Ps 30:6 ; Ps 30:8 ; Ps 51:20 ; Ps 89:18 ; Ps 106:4 ; Prov 8:35 ; Prov 12:2 ; Prov 18:22 ׳ עֵת ר Isa 49:8 ; Ps 69:14 ׳ יוֺם ר Isa 58:5 ׳ שְׁנַתרֿ Isa 61:2 || בְּרָכָה Deut 33:23 opposed to תּוֺעֵבָה Prov 11:1 ; Prov 11:20 ; Prov 12:22 ; Prov 15:8 . \\ \\ b. of men: in general Prov 10:32 ; Prov 11:27 ; Prov 14:9 of kings v Prov 14:35 ; Prov 16:13 ; Prov 16:15 ; Prov 19:12 . 2. acceptance , of persons, offering sacrifice, לרצון לפני יהוה Exod 28:38 ( P ); with ל person for acceptance for him before ׳ י ; with suffix person לרצנוֺ Lev 1:3 abbreviated לְרָצוֺן לָכֶם Lev 22:20 , לרצנכם Lev 19:5 ; Lev 22:19 ; Lev 22:29 ; Lev 23:11 , לצֵּון Lev 22:21 ; Isa 56:7 ; Jer 6:20 ; Ps 19:15 (of words; compare Hos 14:3 ); על רצון Isa 60:7 (read לְ , so Manuscripts, see Gi , also Du ), רצון Mal 2:13 . 3. will, desire, pleasure: \\ \\ a. of God, ׳ עשׂה ר do his will Ezra 10:11 ; Ps 40:9 ; Ps 103:21 ; Ps 143:10 . \\ \\ b. of man, עשׂה כרצונוֺ do according to his will , exactly as he pleased, Dan 8:4 ; Dan 11:3 ; Dan 11:16 ; Dan 11:36 ; Neh 9:24 ; Esth 1:8 ; Esth 9:5 , compare Neh 9:37 desire Ps 145:16 ; Ps 145:19 ; 2Chr 15:15 = self-will Gen 49:6 (poem).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8075')\">BDB8075</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7522')\">H7522</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8074')\">BDB8074</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8076')\">BDB8076</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>רָצוֺן</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>goodwill, favour, acceptance, will</highlightword>; — absolute <